# Surveil 1 with no card to look at does nothing and asks nothing (CR 701.46a, 701.46b), so Bot1 is never offered a
# placement (the control, with a card in the library, is the scenario beside this one); Consider's draw is then from an
# empty library and Bot1 loses (CR 704.5b).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Consider
Island x5

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Consider.Cast
! Bot1.Arrange

[Expect]
Result = Bot2 won
Bot1.Graveyard = Consider
